  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: \r\n$r \\cos \\left(\\theta-\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)=2 \\quad \\Rightarrow r \\cos \\theta \\times \\frac{1}{2}+r \\sin \\theta \\times \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}=2 \\Rightarrow x+\\sqrt{3} y=4(x=r \\cos \\theta, y=r \\sin \\theta)$\r\n$\\therefore$ a straight line",
